		{"id":"59c5ee015167e9e0","type":"text","text":"Maybe use VCG and Asymmetric Nash\nBargaining theory to calculate the market power of the batteries? [[An efficient and incentive-compatible market design for energy storage participation]]","x":-361,"y":455,"width":339,"height":171},
		{"id":"b5d4863ebe918f20","type":"text","text":"Bc even though doing the peak shaving for example is worth for the SW max it isnt for the ESS profit (coming for doing arbitrage at those hours) [[An efficient and incentive-compatible market design for energy storage participation]]","x":200,"y":421,"width":713,"height":120},
		{"id":"b0c0b62fab20d4b3","type":"text","text":"ESS is co-optimizaed in DA and ancilliary services (in ERCOT and PJM) [[3.-A state-of-charge based formulation for storage]]","x":-860,"y":-119,"width":290,"height":138},
		{"id":"a47738af3cca695a","type":"text","text":"How do they do that if the power necesity in ancilliary service is 30% SOC for more than 3 hours straight?","x":-840,"y":140,"width":250,"height":149},
		{"id":"03e308bc71081025","type":"text","text":"Ancilliary service market with energy bids instead of capacity","x":-1037,"y":383,"width":322,"height":72},
		{"id":"8559cd50f8c772bf","x":-893,"y":760,"width":303,"height":190,"type":"text","text":"If an agent's profit-maximization problem is non-convex, its KKT conditions are no longer sufficient for global optimality. Therefore, the standard price-based competitive-equilibrium result may fail."},
		{"id":"764a5e42e683fc9d","x":419,"y":677,"width":276,"height":273,"type":"text","text":"If the centralized ISO problem is convex and the agents' problems are concave maximization problems, their KKT conditions are sufficient for global optimality. Under the appropriate market-clearing and pricing assumptions, the agents' MCP can then reproduce the ISO optimum."},
		{"id":"9d96ebc07b228990","x":-283,"y":758,"width":341,"height":97,"type":"text","text":"Future expected profits w in case it is increasing, the b term (its integral) is no longer convex"},
		{"id":"b85e3174a7be3728","x":663,"y":-270,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"The market design "},
		{"id":"ae03949680da7957","x":280,"y":-396,"width":300,"height":101,"type":"text","text":"the willingness to pay for the ESS generators can be increasing"},
		{"id":"e1be5356f177b56d","x":-981,"y":-601,"width":391,"height":101,"type":"text","text":"Capability of big storage systems to break equilibrium in our new system and the possibilites of reducing tha market power"}
	],
